Z||000000||Taijiguy||06-25-2000||11:19 PM||||Running stock intake setup, (ported and polished) with a monster cam (Sealed Power street/strip cam-480  lift at .050/ 288 deg) Any reason I couldn't run 3.1 injectors in this setup? I got a great deal on a set from my local boneyard and figured I'd inquire before putting them in. Any comments?||||reg||1
