Z||000003||1FST2M6||06-27-2000||12:40 PM||||before you go spending money tossing parts at the car... take it to you local Dynojet shop and see if its really running lean. with an exhaust gas analyzer hooked to it. if it is running lean, go to <A HREF="http://www.splitsec.com" TARGET=_blank>www.splitsec.com</A>  they have an injector pulse modifier that will help you with out replacing the injectors.. or if you have to replace them this unit will let your car run with out a reburn trial and error of the  stock chip. ||||reg||1
